        '19584',
        'Fill program name column on the transaction table',
        'Fill program name column on the transaction table',
        'Dear Archana,  Based on our web session kindly find the below status:  • Issue Reported by the customer: Fill program name column on the transaction table  • Status: Solved.  • Problem description: fill column program name for table transact  • Action Taken – recommended solution: Kindly note that we have filled the column PROGRAM_NAME for the last three months as discussed.  If you need to update additional months, you may use the query below and simply replace the date range in yellow as required:  UPDATE TRANSACT T  SET PROGRAM_NAME = (   SELECT TB.PROGRAM_NAME   FROM TRANSACT@BANKBI TB   WHERE T.TRA_DATE = TB.TRA_DATE   AND T.TRA_SEQ1 = TB.TRA_SEQ1   AND T.TRA_SEQ2 = TB.TRA_SEQ2   AND T.BRA_CODE = TB.BRA_CODE   AND T.CUS_NUM = TB.BRA_CODE || TB.CUS_NUM   AND T.CUR_CODE = TB.CUR_CODE   AND T.LED_CODE = TB.LED_CODE   AND T.SUB_ACCT_CODE = TB.SUB_ACCT_CODE   )  WHERE T.DAY_DATE between ’01-jul-2025’ and ’31-jul-2025’;     ? Kindly check from your side and confirm to close this ticket.',
