        'Dear Moses,    Please note that the issue related to the average balance at has been resolved.    We executed the procedure across three different dates, and the performance has significantly improved — the average execution time is now approximately 10 minutes.    The root cause was traced to the data insertion process into the PIO_ACCT_AVG_BAL_TMP table. The table size had grown to around 900 GB, which heavily impacted performance.    To ensure optimal performance and efficient storage usage moving forward, we recommend backing up previous years’ data and retaining only the last year’s data in the table.    Please check the daily fill for today’s and let us know if any additional support is required.    Thank you,',
