        '19718',
        'CRIF monthly File',
        'CRIF monthly File',
        'Dears     Following discussions with the CRIF team, they have proposed the following approach to resolve the issue and prevent further errors in the data extraction process:    • For months with 31 days, perform the file extraction on the 30th of the month, using the 30th as the reference date in the file.    • Example: For July 2025, extract the file on 30-Jul-2025 with a reference date of 30072025.    • Alternatively, extract the file on the 1st of the following month, using the 1st as the reference date.    • Example: For July 2025, extract the file on 01-Aug-2025 with a reference date of 01082025.    These adjustments are intended to align the data timing with CRIF system expectations and avoid the errors currently being encountered.    Best regards',
