        'Dears,  Based on our web session, please be informed that the screening is working properly, and alerts are being generated as expected.  As discussed with Ms. @teba and as highlighted in the attached email, the main issue arises because the names are being sent from the core system in Arabic, while the screening version in production environment does not support Arabic.  Please note the following updates:  • The latest release has already been installed in the test environment.  • We are currently waiting for the development team to provide the exception file so we can proceed with our monitoring.  • On 15th September, the development team will deliver the final exception file.  • In the meantime, for the production environment, we kindly request that you provide us with the column containing the names in English from the core system so we can apply a temporary solution until the new release is deployed.  Additionally, if the Compliance team encounters any issues, please reach out to us so we can analyze and address them accordingly.  Given the above, we will proceed with closing this ticket and will open a new one should any further issues arise.  Thank You & Best Regards,',
