        '19712',
        'BI users and Groups',
        'Dears,   We kindly request your support and guidance in extracting the following information from the AdminTool:    We need a list of all users on BI systems, specifying the role of each employee(Employee Group) and the function associated with each role.    Best Regards.',
        'Dear Ghassan    As discussed during our meeting session , there is a limitation on SAP BI regarding extracting such data. The SAP BI has too many tools and functions that are stored as encrypted data in the SAP BI repository .  You can use below queries in the SAP BI query builder in the AdminTools to extract similar information taking in consideration changing the SI_KIND to match the target object required (User, Group, Universe, Webi,.. etc)    select si_id,si_name,si_creation_time,si_update_ts,si_aliases,si_lastlogontime from ci_systemobjects where si_kind=''User''     SELECT SI_NAME, SI_CREATION_TIME,SI_AUTHOR,SI_OWNER,SI_SIZE FROM CI_INFOOBJECTS WHERE SI_KIND = ''Webi'' order by SI_CREATION_TIME',
