(
        '19473',
        'Apply the truncate on ODS ETL',
        'Dear Support Team,    Please be informed that we have observed a significant amount of data fragmentation in the staging area (BI_ODS) caused by daily delete /insert operations over the related tables. Our analysis indicates that more than 350 GB of fragmented space has accumulated out of a total 500 GB space (ex. Account table size was 120GB while its normal size 23GB).    We have already performed de-fragmentation on the largest tables and rebuilt the related indexes. However, this process required considerable time and cannot be repeated frequently. Therefore, we kindly request the current delete/insert operations be replaced with TRUNCATE operations or to created a daily partition for these tables, then to drop these partitions, this will reduce fragmentation and improve overall performance.    Waiting your kind response.',
