        'Dear Mohammad,    Based on our web session, kindly find below the status:      • Issue Reported by the customer: ETL issue.    • Status: Solved.    • Problem description: The JCB_LOAD_PLAN ETL job failed in the Serial-ODS2 step at table BI_ODS.LC_EXP_P due to the following error in the column PLACE_OF_CHARGE:    ORA-12899: “value too large for column "BI_ODS"."CS_QA198RFCAPHO50KGUAJ611OAK"."PLACE_OF_CHRG" (actual: 85, maximum: 65)”, This indicates that the column PLACE_OF_CHRG in BI_ODS.LC_EXP_P was defined as VARCHAR2(65 CHAR), while at least one incoming record contained 85 characters.         • Action Taken – recommended solution: Based on our web session, kindly note that the issue was resolved by increasing the column length from 65 characters to 150 characters. Afterwards, the JCB_LOAD_PLAN ETL job was re-executed from the point it had stopped for the date 14/09/2025, and it completed successfully.   Kindly check from your side and confirm to close this ticket.          Best Regards,',
